[8361]={["aftermath"]="Bor welcomed the successful blow against the cult's commanders.",["atomIDs"]={"8361:description:1-97","8361:description:100-220","8361:description:223-293","8361:description:298-381","8361:description:384-458","8361:description:461-496","8361:objective:1-134"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8361:completion:1-4","8361:completion:6-20","8361:completion:22-64"},["opening"]="Observed rituals showed elemental nobles issuing orders to the cult. Bor did not know whether they were gods or intermediaries, but saw their place in the command chain as reason to strike.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to contact a templar and recover its crest.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the abyssal crest.",["sourceHash"]="39fe56fe5ed830cfd0f1a271f9095b26a835ee19b7857368178c7fe8564966eb",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8365]={["atomIDs"]={"8365:description:1-32","8365:description:34-53","8365:description:55-74","8365:description:76-163","8365:description:166-277","8365:description:280-340","8365:description:345-377","8365:description:379-463","8365:description:465-497","8365:objective:1-116"},["opening"]="Haughty claimed a place as fashion supplier to Azeroth's elite. Her next profitable choice drew on Lost Rigger Cove: twenty Southsea pirate hats acquired by whatever means the work required.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to collect twenty Southsea Pirate Hats for Haughty.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered twenty Southsea Pirate Hats to Haughty Modiste.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="f4fe9c9a8df5b7844783c1b04961fe0583bd2b2cc3b273260722cd53fee7408d",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8366]={["atomIDs"]={"8366:description:1-5","8366:description:7-39","8366:description:44-115","8366:description:118-209","8366:description:214-315","8366:description:317-396","8366:description:401-472","8366:description:475-502","8366:objective:1-179"},["opening"]="The pirates had disregarded the Cartel's protection payments. Steamwheedle's security chief could not leave his own peacekeeping post, so he temporarily deputized help for a four-part strike on Lost Rigger Cove.",["pending"]="{actor} would confront ten each of the specified Southsea pirates, freebooters, dock workers and swashbucklers.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the four-part Southsea assignment for Security Chief Bilgewhizzle.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="bb5bc52a4a3a8194cf19eab8b4e24552b3e76bf999e2dd8241898951207b8367",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8367]={["aftermath"]="The Warbringer accepted the tokens as evidence of courage and strength, and acclaimed their bearer as a hero of the Horde.",["atomIDs"]={"8367:description:1-94","8367:description:96-202","8367:description:204-310","8367:description:315-414","8367:description:416-425","8367:description:427-440","8367:objective:1-152"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8367:completion:1-99","8367:completion:101-137","8367:completion:139-187","8367:completion:189-210","8367:completion:212-267"},["opening"]="The Horde Warbringer argued that victory required coordinated service across the battlefronts. Marks from Alterac Valley, Arathi Basin, and Warsong Gulch would show that a fighter had answered more than one front.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to present three marks from each of the three named battlefields.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} presented the requested battlefield marks to the Horde Warbringer.",["sourceConflicts"]={"Description also names Eye of the Storm; objective requests marks only from Alterac Valley, Arathi Basin, and Warsong Gulch. Narrative follows the explicit objective."},["sourceHash"]="6d98c5150ad3ab06206acc6fdf6cff5dd0f6a94da9908c39923c6d80645b220d",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8368]={["atomIDs"]={"8368:description:1-84","8368:description:87-229","8368:description:234-260","8368:description:263-329","8368:objective:1-79"},["opening"]="The warbringer defended the Horde's lumber operations as a necessary source of material. In his account, Silverwing resistance denied the Horde resources that did not belong to the Alliance.",["pending"]="{actor} would take three Warsong marks to a Horde warbringer.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered three Warsong marks to the warbringer.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_REVIEWED_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW_PENDING",["sourceHash"]="483e369547d71f443726fc90a68629c631e7577b92f3b8455a0ad58b14ccce21",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVariantNote"]="Source-equivalent commission variants preserve their own IDs, levels and branch masks; wording does not imply distinct canonical events."},
[8369]={["aftermath"]="The warbringer promised to report the service to superiors.",["atomIDs"]={"8369:description:1-14","8369:description:17-172","8369:description:175-320","8369:description:323-354","8369:objective:1-86"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8369:completion:1-69","8369:completion:71-109"},["opening"]="The Horde warbringer rejected any account that obscured the Stormpike invasion of Frostwolf territory. Marks brought from Alterac would stand as evidence of answering that call to defense.",["pending"]="{actor} would bring three Alterac marks to a Horde warbringer.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} presented the three Alterac marks to the warbringer.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_REVIEWED_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW_PENDING",["sourceHash"]="6602a5550ba60015a9b3a2a896c956644e1b0baeffe8bd38417f5a81b2b0dd88",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8370]={["aftermath"]="The warbringer praised the work of securing the Horde's resources.",["atomIDs"]={"8370:description:1-59","8370:description:62-158","8370:description:163-232","8370:description:235-356","8370:description:359-419","8370:objective:1-83"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"8370:completion:1-54","8370:completion:56-76"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Bring three basin marks to a Horde warbringer.",["opening"]="The warbringer described open war over Arathi's resources, with little pretense left between the armies. Keeping those supplies flowing to the Defilers meant denying weapons and provisions to the Alliance.",["pending"]="{actor} would present the basin's marks to a Horde warbringer.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered three Arathi Basin marks to the warbringer.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="74e9ea726e57816817d80f9277e008dcbcf2ec6e7b8ce31e4f0095fb1085fee2",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
[8371]={["atomIDs"]={"8371:description:1-76","8371:description:81-179","8371:description:182-297","8371:description:302-386","8371:description:388-411","8371:description:414-506","8371:objective:1-160"},["opening"]="The brigadier treated the battlegrounds as connected fronts. Resources denied in one place might change another battle, so he wanted evidence of service across all three rather than expertise confined to one field.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to bring three Marks of Honor from each active battleground.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered three Alterac Valley, three Arathi Basin and three Warsong Gulch Marks of Honor to an Alliance Brigadier General.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="d01cf1b9688ca21eddff8692abd32bada1ab11b8b88a88f73ea5eea476d05c9c",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8372]={["atomIDs"]={"8372:description:1-121","8372:description:124-216","8372:description:221-318","8372:description:321-402","8372:description:407-457","8372:description:460-476","8372:objective:1-96"},["opening"]="The Alliance brigadier saw more than felled trees at stake. Ashenvale's forest was a strategic barrier; without it, Astranaar would be exposed to a larger attack from the Barrens.",["pending"]="{actor} would bring three Warsong marks to an Alliance brigadier.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} presented three Warsong marks for the Alliance's recognition.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_REVIEWED_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW_PENDING",["sourceHash"]="dfde6ae29df0d22549e9e483b0f65f157f2dfb2031844c83c5a89739551963ec",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["sourceVariantNote"]="Source-equivalent commission variants preserve their own IDs, levels and branch masks; wording does not imply distinct canonical events."},
[8373]={["atomIDs"]={"8373:description:1-96","8373:description:99-176","8373:description:181-289","8373:description:292-339","8373:description:344-447","8373:description:450-464","8373:objective:1-93","8373:objective:96-153"},["editorialVersion"]=2,["endingAtomIDs"]={"8373:completion:1-48","8373:completion:50-56","8373:completion:61-138","8373:completion:140-174","8373:completion:176-335"},["opening"]="Hartman wants Southshore's celebration free of Forsaken stink bombs. His pine cleaner offers an immediate answer to the unpleasant mess dropped around the village.",["pending"]="{actor} would clean a stink bomb and return to Hartman.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} removed the bomb, earning Hartman's thanks for a cleaner Southshore.",["sourceHash"]="3f4669b028cc6362733479f860174e2b3fdebcd16961995a1b1e3ae815bfc646",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8374]={["aftermath"]="The brigadier encouraged further service against the Horde.",["atomIDs"]={"8374:description:1-80","8374:description:83-148","8374:description:153-260","8374:description:265-350","8374:description:353-452","8374:description:455-511","8374:objective:1-95"},["coverageQualification"]="INDIVIDUALLY_AUTHORED_RETAINED_SOURCE_ACCOUNT",["endingAtomIDs"]={"8374:completion:1-19","8374:completion:21-94"},["minimumStage"]=2,["objectiveSummary"]="Bring three basin marks to an Alliance brigadier general.",["opening"]="The Alliance's appeal for Arathi rested on production as much as tactics. Its mines and workshops would forge weapons for whichever army held them, making each claim to the basin a struggle over who would arm the next battle.",["pending"]="{actor} would bring the basin's marks to an Alliance brigadier general.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} presented three Arathi Basin marks to the brigadier general.",["reviewStatus"]="AUTHOR_SOURCE_READ_NOT_INDEPENDENTLY_CERTIFIED",["sourceHash"]="fe6501dc795f61644ef3b67b623e46fc15fe08ff95f7a6f0bc3350670ad7add2",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639",["unresolvedFields"]={"currentServerPlayability"}},
