[8446]={["atomIDs"]={"8446:description:1-34","8446:description:39-122","8446:description:124-188","8446:description:190-267","8446:objective:1-85","8446:objective:90-137"},["editorialVersion"]=2,["endingAtomIDs"]={"8446:completion:1-41","8446:completion:43-113","8446:completion:115-128"},["opening"]="A corrupt object may be connected to dragons emerging from the Dream. A powerful druid is needed to interpret it rather than accepting that possible connection as certainty.",["pending"]="{actor} would seek someone able to understand the object.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the object to Remulos, who prepared to remove its taint.",["sourceHash"]="b2487447cfbb368a39847117894e4e22379b4667e34ca8de35ffb408ba043df1",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8447]={["atomIDs"]={"8447:description:1-82","8447:description:84-129","8447:objective:1-82"},["editorialVersion"]=2,["endingAtomIDs"]={"8447:completion:1-18","8447:completion:20-59","8447:completion:61-103"},["opening"]="Remulos believes Lake Elune'ara's waters can dissolve the nightmares around the object. The learner must wait while the keeper performs the cleansing.",["pending"]="{actor} would wait for Remulos's ritual.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} witnessed the cleansing; Remulos offered the ring that had served Malfurion.",["sourceHash"]="580fceafad55f373dc6492ed7d4c8ab96db156b2108ec5cb40214096b056777b",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8460]={["aftermath"]="Grazle acknowledged growing friendship through the defense of his people.",["atomIDs"]={"8460:description:1-66","8460:description:68-170","8460:description:172-225","8460:description:230-268","8460:description:270-360","8460:description:362-449","8460:objective:1-116","8460:objective:119-197"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8460:completion:1-43","8460:completion:46-108","8460:completion:111-182"},["opening"]="Grazle explained why uncorrupted Timbermaw trusted few outsiders: other peoples killed furbolgs without distinguishing friend from foe. Opposing the corrupted Deadwood offered a first way to earn trust.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to confront the southern Deadwood groups.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Grazle's assignment.",["sourceHash"]="4b7bcbbf6d7b0a20819c7ba6d7bc8bee5bc39a234227e42dbd7f44cfe6888af1",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8461]={["aftermath"]="Nafien called victory hollow and warned that wider acceptance required perseverance without ever turning weapons on Timbermaw.",["atomIDs"]={"8461:description:1-63","8461:description:66-156","8461:description:161-247","8461:description:250-323","8461:description:326-375","8461:description:380-426","8461:description:429-503","8461:objective:1-99","8461:objective:102-171"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8461:completion:1-39","8461:completion:42-51","8461:completion:53-103","8461:completion:106-166","8461:completion:171-259","8461:completion:262-342","8461:completion:345-432"},["opening"]="Nafien saw fel corruption rather than innate hostility in the tribe he had to oppose. The nearby camp still endangered Timbermaw, but he asked to be spared details of fighting his own kin.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to confront the northern Deadwood groups.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned from Nafien's assignment.",["sourceHash"]="13f669c85ed11cb54fb5d2cbf9bc6a1f32eae95a617f7117f1bb4a9b413ffe91",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8462]={["aftermath"]="Nafien welcomed the offer while warning that unproven strangers could still meet hostility inside.",["atomIDs"]={"8462:description:1-75","8462:description:78-126","8462:description:131-235","8462:description:238-324","8462:description:327-393","8462:objective:1-84","8462:objective:87-141"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8462:completion:7-125","8462:completion:127-205","8462:completion:210-326","8462:completion:328-372","8462:completion:375-460"},["opening"]="Grazle directed further aid north toward the Hold's guard. Nafien's appearance was no reason to fear him; his need concerned the same corrupt forces threatening their home.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to find Nafien by the Hold.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reached the northern guard.",["sourceHash"]="5936e6e6d06a9a3b36a09744506ffe028c6d11588ffade7cba777bfabb8c0790",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8464]={["aftermath"]="Salfa asked for continued help because Timbermaw had few allies and could not face every threat alone.",["atomIDs"]={"8464:description:1-45","8464:description:48-153","8464:description:158-232","8464:description:235-354","8464:description:359-430","8464:description:433-493","8464:objective:1-94","8464:objective:97-173"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8464:completion:1-56","8464:completion:59-91","8464:completion:96-148","8464:completion:151-296"},["opening"]="Salfa's people preferred distance from other tribes, but Winterfall rage now threatened them directly. He sought reduced numbers at the eastern village while regretting conflict with their brethren.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to confront the three Winterfall groups.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Salfa's village assignment.",["sourceHash"]="edd2cfc5755eed93e2b4725dfde1a8a84f3d27365e64f3f0fd39721f89654ab0",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8465]={["aftermath"]="Salfa accepted the offer to help against the corrupted Winterfall.",["atomIDs"]={"8465:description:1-148","8465:description:151-258","8465:description:261-300","8465:description:305-383","8465:description:386-431","8465:description:434-509","8465:objective:1-57","8465:objective:60-133"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8465:completion:1-123","8465:completion:128-245","8465:completion:247-345"},["opening"]="Corruption threatened from east as well as south. Nafien directed the route through the Hold toward Salfa, warning that fighting even in self-defense would further estrange any traveler still considered hostile.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to reach Salfa beyond the Hold.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with the Winterspring guard.",["sourceHash"]="2f75097649e3056832bcc010afe16e48087852780c4a8d4d277f9743f7fc4b38",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8470]={["aftermath"]="Kernda recognized corruption within the object and proposed study and ritual to discover its source.",["atomIDs"]={"8470:description:1-59","8470:description:62-160","8470:description:163-298","8470:description:303-378","8470:description:380-451","8470:objective:1-119","8470:objective:122-217"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8470:completion:1-13","8470:completion:15-96","8470:completion:98-183","8470:completion:188-225","8470:completion:227-326","8470:completion:328-401"},["opening"]="The plain totem carried a despair disproportionate to its appearance. A trusted visitor might take that evidence of Deadwood corruption into the Hold for examination.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to show the totem while holding neutral standing or better.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered it to Kernda.",["sourceHash"]="2ccdea01b36c70889807db182850a5fa063456a1b8c9d507a20a7e0b45274047",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8471]={["aftermath"]="Kernda recognized a corruption beyond his understanding and resolved to study the object in hope of ending the tribe's rage.",["atomIDs"]={"8471:description:1-61","8471:description:64-183","8471:description:186-314","8471:description:319-394","8471:description:396-467","8471:objective:1-121","8471:objective:124-219"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8471:completion:1-13","8471:completion:15-126","8471:completion:128-214","8471:completion:219-272","8471:completion:274-372","8471:completion:377-458"},["opening"]="The totem's plain shape concealed an almost tangible dread. A trusted visitor could bring the evidence into the Hold, where Timbermaw might study what had turned Winterfall against them.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to show the totem at neutral standing or better.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered it to Kernda.",["sourceHash"]="1889d517df512591f14322805c43b2cd5acdc8c8949a2d92b52320d7fddb33a7",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8481]={["aftermath"]="Gorn welcomed safety for the Hold and a chance of survival for Winterfall, while acknowledging slow healing and continued conflict.",["atomIDs"]={"8481:description:1-145","8481:description:150-238","8481:description:241-303","8481:description:306-358","8481:description:361-462","8481:description:464-499","8481:objective:1-111","8481:objective:114-204"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8481:completion:1-9","8481:completion:11-26","8481:completion:29-123","8481:completion:126-163","8481:completion:168-205","8481:completion:208-377","8481:completion:382-412"},["opening"]="A summoning method offered a strike at the demon dominating Winterfall. Its essence was needed not for an instant cure but to begin the long healing of the tribe.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to summon Xandivious and recover its essence.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the essence to Gorn.",["sourceHash"]="a35930f6756c031fe4c0dc1f1ca7d1e0e21570ea24dc57b5d10c50895ff563ea",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8484]={["aftermath"]="Magni welcomed the possibility of lasting peace and planned further diplomats and notice to Alliance leaders.",["atomIDs"]={"8484:description:1-51","8484:description:54-156","8484:description:161-283","8484:description:286-363","8484:description:366-464","8484:objective:1-77"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8484:completion:1-49","8484:completion:52-176","8484:completion:178-230","8484:completion:233-342","8484:completion:347-363","8484:completion:365-419","8484:completion:422-468"},["opening"]="Gorn treated the service as grounds for contact with the Alliance. The offering acknowledged Magni's earlier attempts to communicate and carried a proposal for peace to Ironforge.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to take the offering to Magni.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Timbermaw's peace offering.",["sourceHash"]="faf2b8c93c3215b58c9c4992a4107d62128303f52ea7a15d1d720da3f3b5a6db",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8485]={["aftermath"]="Thrall welcomed the diplomatic opening and promised notification of Horde leaders and additional envoys.",["atomIDs"]={"8485:description:1-51","8485:description:54-156","8485:description:161-288","8485:description:291-365","8485:description:368-463","8485:objective:1-61"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8485:completion:1-49","8485:completion:51-189","8485:completion:191-297","8485:completion:302-318","8485:completion:320-374","8485:completion:376-422"},["opening"]="Timbermaw's offering answered earlier outreach from the Horde's warchief. Gorn hoped the deeds of one representative could open peace with that representative's people.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to bring the offering to Thrall.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered it in Orgrimmar.",["sourceHash"]="1c53cebca0db13fdec3eff917a46788fea2919ea55a058305b1814a83f93fc8f",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
